---
import SlideLayout from '../../../layouts/SlideLayout.astro';
---
<SlideLayout
  title="Slide 02 - Jeden diagram, wiele problemów"
  bgImage="/images/background-2.jpg"
  bgOverlay="linear-gradient(rgba(10,14,23,0.72), rgba(10,14,23,0.84))"
>
  <div class="content">
    <h1 class="title">
      Jeden diagram, <span class="highlight">wiele problemów</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="ti ti-arrows-shuffle"></i></div>
        <h3>Brak wspólnej<br>notacji</h3>
        <span class="divider"></span>
        <p>Każdy zespół rysuje inaczej. Każdy zespół ma swoją notację</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="ti ti-users-group"></i></div>
        <h3>Brak<br>odbiorcy</h3>
        <span class="divider"></span>
        <p>Jeden rysunek dla biznesu, architekta i nowego developera naraz.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="ti ti-stack-2"></i></div>
        <h3>Mieszanie<br>poziomów</h3>
        <span class="divider"></span>
        <p>Szczegóły implementacyjne i koncepty biznesowe na jednym widoku</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="ti ti-clock-x"></i></div>
        <h3>Brak<br>aktualizacji</h3>
        <span class="divider"></span>
        <p>Diagram opisuje stan, który już nie istnieje.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</SlideLayout>

<style is:global>
  .stage {
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .content {
    max-width: 1640px;
    padding: 140px 3rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .title {
    font-size: 80px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 0.25s forwards;
  }

  .title .highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan-400), var(--cyan-600));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 36px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .card {
    position: relative;
    background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.55);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 48px 36px 44px;
    text-align: center;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(24px);
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.55s; }
  .card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.70s; }
  .card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.85s; }
  .card:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 1.00s; }

  .icon-wrap {
    width: 110px;
    height: 110px;
    margin: 0 auto 30px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(34,211,238,0.18), rgba(34,211,238,0.04) 70%);
  }

  .icon-wrap i {
    font-size: 58px;
    color: var(--cyan-400);
  }

  .card h3 {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f1f5f9;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  }

  .card p {
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .divider {
    display: block;
    width: 44px;
    height: 2px;
    margin: 0 auto 22px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--cyan-500), transparent);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
